                                              'instructions. No previous schema, roles, task fields, '
                                              'annotations or target answers are supplied.\n'
                                              'Read the whole document, including its opening, body and '
                                              'ending. Identify all distinct organizing contexts and local '
                                              'communicative purposes that are needed to describe its actual '
                                              'uses; this is not a search for a few interesting examples. Do '
                                              'not return only a top-ranked subset, impose a fixed role '
